<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Sporitelna cuts base rate to 15.5pct.</title>
<headline>Czech Sporitelna cuts base rate to 15.5pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech savings bank, Ceska Sporitelna a.s., said on Wednesday that it would cut its base lending rate to 15.5 percent from 16.6 percent with effect from Thursday.</p>
</text>
